@startuml
title UniLib PA3 — Login — UC-01
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
participant "User" as p0
participant "Login UI" as p1
participant "Auth HTTP API" as p2
participant "Auth handler" as p3
participant "Prisma/PostgreSQL" as p4
p0 -> p1 : Enter username/password
p1 -> p2 : Login request (route TBD)
p2 -> p3 : Validate credentials / role (method TBD)
p3 -> p4 : Fetch user and password hash
p3 -> p2 : Success token OR failure
p2 -> p1 : 200/401/inactive (status TBD)
p1 --> p2 : result
note over p0,p4
alt: wrong password -> generic 401; inactive account -> response code/status TBD. Vinh must verify real route and handler.
end note
@enduml
